WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.792 --> 00:00:16.648
Water splashed.

2
00:00:16.649 --> 00:00:20.139
"Yay!" Dipper cheered.

3
00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:22.846
Gasser drove through the water again.

4
00:00:22.847 --> 00:00:26.790
Splash!

5
00:00:26.791 --> 00:00:31.484
"Do it again, Gasser!" Poppy said.

6
00:00:31.485 --> 00:00:34.710
Just then Ms. Fender drove over.

7
00:00:34.711 --> 00:00:37.167
"Gasser," she said.

8
00:00:37.168 --> 00:00:40.327
"Stop that right now!"

9
00:00:40.328 --> 00:00:42.557
Gasser frowned.

10
00:00:42.558 --> 00:00:45.247
"Sorry," he said.

11
00:00:45.248 --> 00:00:49.060
"Just play in the sand," Ms. Fender said.

12
00:00:49.061 --> 00:01:00.280
"Water is not for cars!"

13
00:01:00.281 --> 00:01:04.361
Ms. Fender drove off.

14
00:01:04.362 --> 00:01:08.951
Gasser waited for a moment.

15
00:01:08.952 --> 00:01:12.555
"Ms. Fender is gone," he said.

16
00:01:12.556 --> 00:01:15.182
Brumm, brumm!

17
00:01:15.183 --> 00:01:18.047
Gasser sped through the water again.

18
00:01:18.048 --> 00:01:23.564
Everyone laughed.

19
00:01:23.565 --> 00:01:28.900
"The water feels great," Dipper said.

20
00:01:28.901 --> 00:01:31.503
"I'm going in!"

21
00:01:31.504 --> 00:01:34.286
"No, Dipper!" Eddy said.

22
00:01:34.287 --> 00:01:37.298
"It's fine," Dipper said.

23
00:01:37.299 --> 00:01:41.605
Dipper drove into the water.

24
00:01:41.606 --> 00:01:53.652
She went in deeper and deeper.

25
00:01:53.653 --> 00:01:56.214
Dipper called to her friends.

26
00:01:56.215 --> 00:02:07.956
"Come on in!" she said.
